  "selected_article": "<html><head><meta content=\"世紀*連3日跌停 7.7萬張賣單排隊 股民哀號：完全沒想讓我們自由買賣 - 自由財經\" itemprop=\"name\" property=\"og:title\"/><meta content=\"https://ec.ltn.com.tw/article/breakingnews/5574307\" itemprop=\"url\" property=\"og:url\"/><meta content=\"2026-09-15T11:55:27+08:00\" itemprop=\"datePublished\" name=\"pubdate\" property=\"article:published_time\"/><meta content=\"2026-09-15T11:55:27+08:00\" property=\"article:published_time\"/></head><body><div class=\"whitecon boxTitle boxText\" data-desc=\"內文\">\n<h1>世紀*連3日跌停 7.7萬張賣單排隊 股民哀號：完全沒想讓我們自由買賣</h1>\n<div class=\"function\">\n<span class=\"time\">2026/09/15 11:55</span>\n<div class=\"google-sourceBtn\">\n<a class=\"gsButton\" data-tooltip=\"請點選打勾將自由時報設為首選來源，在 Google 上查看更多我們的精彩報導\" href=\"https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=ltn.com.tw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<svg class=\"gsBtnIcon\" fill=\"none\" height=\"22\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M22.296 9.944h-.846V9.9H12v4.2h5.934A6.297 6.297 0 0 1 5.7 12 6.3 6.3 0 0 1 12 5.7c1.606 0 3.067.606 4.18 1.595l2.97-2.97A10.45 10.45 0 0 0 12 1.5C6.202 1.5 1.5 6.201 1.5 12S6.202 22.5 12 22.5c5.799 0 10.5-4.701 10.5-10.5 0-.704-.072-1.391-.204-2.056\" fill=\"#FFC107\"></path>\n<path d=\"m2.71 7.113 3.45 2.53A6.3 6.3 0 0 1 12 5.7c1.606 0 3.067.606 4.18 1.595l2.97-2.97A10.45 10.45 0 0 0 12 1.5c-4.033 0-7.53 2.277-9.29 5.613\" fill=\"#FF3D00\"></path>\n<path d=\"M12 22.5c2.712 0 5.176-1.038 7.04-2.726l-3.25-2.75A6.25 6.25 0 0 1 12 18.3a6.3 6.3 0 0 1-5.924-4.172l-3.424 2.639C4.39 20.167 7.92 22.5 12 22.5\" fill=\"#4CAF50\"></path>\n<path d=\"M22.296 9.9H12v4.2h5.934a6.3 6.3 0 0 1-2.146 2.925l.002-.001 3.25 2.75c-.23.209 3.46-2.524 3.46-7.774 0-.704-.072-1.435-.204-2.1\" fill=\"#1976D2\"></path>\n</svg>\n<span class=\"gsBtnText\">加入Google首選</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n<a class=\"sharefb\" data-desc=\"FB分享\" onclick=\"window.open('https://www.facebook.com/share.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fec.ltn.com.tw%2Farticle%2Fbreakingnews%2F5574307%3Futm_medium%3DR%26utm_campaign%3DSHARE%26utm_source%3DFACEBOOK', 'FB-share', 'height=500,width=500');\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FB分享\"></a>\n<a class=\"sharetwitter\" data-desc=\"TWITTER分享\" onclick=\"window.open('https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%E4%B8%96%E7%B4%80%2A%E9%80%A33%E6%97%A5%E8%B7%8C%E5%81%9C+7.7%E8%90%AC%E5%BC%B5%E8%B3%A3%E5%96%AE%E6%8E%92%E9%9A%8A+%E8%82%A1%E6%B0%91%E5%93%80%E8%99%9F%EF%BC%9A%E5%AE%8C%E5%85%A8%E6%B2%92%E6%83%B3%E8%AE%93%E6%88%91%E5%80%91%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E8%B2%B7%E8%B3%A3+http%3A%2F%2Fec.ltn.com.tw%2Farticle%2Fbreakingnews%2F5574307%3Futm_medium%3DR%26utm_campaign%3DSHARE%26utm_source%3DTWITTER', 'TWITTER-share', 'height=500,width=500')\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"TWITTER分享\"></a>\n<a class=\"shareline\" data-desc=\"LINE分享\" onclick=\"window.open('https://lineit.line.me/share/ui?url=http%3A%2F%2Fec.ltn.com.tw%2Farticle%2Fbreakingnews%2F5574307%3Futm_medium%3DR%26utm_campaign%3DSHARE%26utm_source%3DLINE', 'Line-share', 'height=500,width=500');\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"LINE分享\"></a>\n<a class=\"print boxText\" data-desc=\"列印頁\" href=\"https://ec.ltn.com.tw/article/breakingnews/5574307/print\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"列印\"></a>\n<a class=\"fontsize boxText\" data-desc=\"文字縮放\" href=\"javascript:;\" title=\"文字縮放\"></a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><span class=\"ph_b ph_d1\"><span class=\"ph_i\"><img alt=\"世紀*（5314）近期股價持續走弱。（圖擷取自世紀*官網）\" class=\"lazy_imgs_ltn imagePopup\" data-src=\"https://img.ltn.com.tw/Upload/business/page/800/2026/09/15/php3oPn67.jpg\" src=\"assets/images/default.jpg\"/></span><span class=\"ph_d\">世紀*（5314）近期股價持續走弱。（圖擷取自世紀*官網）</span></span><br/>〔財經頻道／綜合報導〕世紀*（5314）近期股價持續走弱，今（15日）開盤再度遭遇沉重賣壓，股價直接摜至跌停價34.2元，連續第3個交易日亮燈跌停，盤面賣壓持續受到市場關注。</p>\n<p>截至上午11點30分，世紀*成交量約6087張，雖然盤中持續有成交，但跌停價仍有超過7.7萬張委賣單排隊，顯示短線市場賣壓依舊沉重，買盤承接力道相對有限。</p>\n<p>世紀*連續3個交易日出現猛烈跌勢，加上跌停價前方堆積大量賣單，引發投資人熱烈討論。部分股民開始擔心世紀後續走勢，紛紛在網路論壇區表達看法，包括「依然綠燈…會綠到除息嗎…」、「大割特割，割好割滿」、「一直賣不掉」、「完全沒想讓我們自由買賣！」以及「這隻不會跟尚茂一樣吧」等，反映投資人面對連續跌停及龐大賣單的焦慮情緒。<br/><br/>另有投資人提醒，面對近期股價劇烈波動，仍應留意投資風險，認為「怎麼上去，怎麼下來，適時停利，不要心存僥倖」，呼籲投資人審慎看待短線行情。</p><p class=\"before_ir\" style=\"text-align: center; display: none;\">請繼續往下閱讀...</p> <!-- /21202031/06-ec-sub-P-IR1 -->\n<div class=\"boxTitle adHeight250 suggest_pc\" data-desc=\"廣告ad-PCIR1\" id=\"ad-PCIR1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<script>displayDFP('ad-PCIR1', 'pc');</script>\n</div>\n<!-- /21202031/06-ec-mobile-sub-P-IR1 -->\n<div class=\"boxTitle suggestCenter adHeight280 suggest_m\" data-desc=\"廣告ad-IR1\" id=\"ad-IR1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<script>displayDFP('ad-IR1', 'm');</script>\n</div>\n<p class=\"after_ir\" style=\"display: none;\"></p>\n<p>目前世紀*已連續3個交易日跌停，今日跌停價34.2元仍有逾7.7萬張賣單排隊，短線賣壓能否獲得消化，以及後續是否出現承接買盤，將成為市場觀察焦點。<br/><br/></p>\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: 720px; position: relative;\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" height=\"720px\" src=\"https://stock.ltn.com.tw/embed/5314/latest-news@KChart/歷史分析/?embedMeta=%7B%22iFetch%22%3A%7B%22securityCode%22%3A%225314%22%2C%22timeScaleType%22%3A%22day_detail%22%2C%22startDate%22%3A%222025-09-15T01%3A00%3A00.000Z%22%2C%22priceType%22%3A%22day_detail%22%7D%2C%22displayTag%22%3A%5B%22%E6%97%A5%E7%B7%9A%22%5D%2C%22extraParameter%22%3A%7B%22event_category%22%3A%22stock%22%2C%22graphIndex%22%3A1%2C%22GA%22%3A%22%7B%5C%22type%5C%22%3A%5C%22stock_page%5C%22%2C%5C%22chart_category%5C%22%3A%5C%22%E6%AD%B7%E5%8F%B2%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%5C%22%2C%5C%22period%5C%22%3A%5C%22%E6%97%A5%E7%B7%9A%5C%22%2C%5C%22report_type%5C%22%3A%5C%22%5C%22%2C%5C%22chart_type%5C%22%3A%5C%22kchart%5C%22%7D%22%2C%22isShowPriceLimitLine%22%3Atrue%2C%22stockType%22%3A%22STOCK%22%2C%22originLink%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fstock.ltn.com.tw%2Fstock%2F5314%2Flatest-news%3FgraphIndex%3D1%26utm_source%3Dstock.ltn.com.tw%26utm_medium%3Dembed%22%7D%7D\" title=\"歷史分析 | 財富自由\" width=\"100%\"></iframe> <a href=\"https://stock.ltn.com.tw/stock/53